SilphCo_11F_Text_ObtainedMasterBallFromPresident::
    .string "{PLAYER} obtained a ROOTBOX from\n"
    .string "the PRESIDENT!$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_ThatsOurSecretPrototype::
    .string "PRESIDENT: You can't buy that\n"
    .string "anywhere!\p"
    .string "It's our secret prototype ROOTBOX!\p"
    .string "It will bind any DAEMON without\n"
    .string "fail!\p"
    .string "You should be quiet about using it,\n"
    .string "though.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_YouHaveNoRoomForThis::
    .string "You have no room for this.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_ThanksForRescuingUs::
    .string "SECRETARY: Thank you for rescuing\n"
    .string "all of us.\p"
    .string "We, from the PRESIDENT down,\n"
    .string "are indebted to you.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_GiovanniIntro::
    .string "Ah. {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "The PRESIDENT and I are agreeing\n"
    .string "terms.\p"
    .string "Since you are here. Everyone\n"
    .string "protects what they value.\p"
    .string "That is not the fault.\p"
    .string "The fault is that protecting is\n"
    .string "easier to measure than the thing.\p"
    .string "So they improve the protecting.\n"
    .string "For years.\p"
    .string "And go on calling it by the name\n"
    .string "of the thing.\p"
    .string "I do not make that error.\p"
    .string "Stand aside.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_GiovanniDefeat::
    .string "Hm.\p"
    .string "That is a result.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_GiovanniPostBattle::
    .string "You have cost me a quarter.\n"
    .string "Not a company.\p"
    .string "The work continues, because the\n"
    .string "work was never mine.\p"
    .string "It is the shape of the thing.\p"
    .string "You are measuring well.\n"
    .string "I will see you again.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "Please wait here. Someone will be\n"
    .string "with you shortly.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Don't…\n"
    .string "Please!$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "You'd like to see the BOSS.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Do you have an appointment with\n"
    .string "the BOSS?$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Off the roadmap.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "Mind how you go. The BOSS sets a\n"
    .string "high bar.$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_MonitorHasMonsOnIt::
    .string "The monitor has DAEMON on it!$"

SilphCo_11F_Text_FloorSign::
    .string "FOUNDRY CO. HEAD OFFICE 11F$"

